  "sourceManual": "Added manually",
  "aboutScreenTitle": "About & privacy",
  "aboutCollectTitle": "What we collect",
  "aboutCollectBody": "Nothing. Your transactions, budgets and notes stay on this phone. There is no server, no account and no sign-in, so there is nowhere for them to go — the app cannot send your data out even if it wanted to.",
  "aboutReadTitle": "What we read, and why",
  "aboutReadBody": "Each permission below is asked for exactly one reason. Hand any of them back in Android settings and the app keeps working — you just type more of it yourself.",
  "aboutPermSmsTitle": "Bank SMS",
  "aboutPermSmsBody": "Transaction alerts from banks, cards and wallets only — the amount, the merchant and the date. OTPs, passwords and personal messages are dropped before anything else looks at them, and no message is ever sent anywhere.",
  "aboutPermNotifyTitle": "Payment app notifications",
  "aboutPermNotifyBody": "With your permission, SpendStory reads notifications from the payment apps you choose — PhonePe, Google Pay, Paytm and the rest — so a UPI payment lands in the ledger the moment it happens.",
  "aboutPermAlertsTitle": "Notifications from us",
  "aboutPermAlertsBody": "Only for the budget warnings and payment reminders you switch on yourself. Nothing else is ever notified.",
  "aboutPermLockTitle": "Fingerprint or face (optional)",
  "aboutPermLockBody": "Used only to open the app on this phone. The reading stays inside Android — SpendStory never sees it.",
  "aboutPermInternetTitle": "Internet",
  "aboutPermInternetBody": "Needed for the ads in the free version and for Play billing. No transaction, amount, merchant or category ever travels with an ad request.",
  "aboutRightsTitle": "Your rights over your data",
  "aboutRightAccessTitle": "See all of it",
  "aboutRightAccessBody": "Take the whole ledger out as CSV or JSON from Settings, any time, free.",
  "aboutRightCorrectTitle": "Correct anything",
  "aboutRightCorrectBody": "Edit any transaction, change its category, or delete it. A wrong guess by the parser is yours to overrule.",
  "aboutRightEraseTitle": "Erase everything",
  "aboutRightEraseBody": "Settings, Delete all data, confirm twice — every transaction, budget and category is gone from this phone immediately.",
  "aboutRightWithdrawTitle": "Take permission back",
  "aboutRightWithdrawBody": "Turn SMS or notification access off in Android settings whenever you like. The app goes back to manual entry — nothing is held hostage.",
  "aboutEraseTitle": "How to delete everything",
  "aboutEraseStep1": "Open Settings → Delete all data.",
  "aboutEraseStep2": "Confirm twice. The second confirmation lists what is about to go.",
  "aboutEraseStep3": "Uninstalling the app takes the database and every setting with it.",
  "aboutContactTitle": "Questions or complaints",
  "aboutContactBody": "Write to us and we answer within 30 days. Your data is on your phone, so we cannot look at your ledger — but we can fix what is broken.",
  "aboutGrievanceEmail": "Support email",
  "aboutEmailMissing": "The support address is being set up. Until it is live, open an issue on the source repository below.",
  "aboutSourceTitle": "Source code",
  "aboutSourceBody": "The whole app is public. Every sentence on this screen can be checked against it.",
  "aboutTapToCopy": "Tap to copy",
  "aboutCopied": "Copied",
  "privacyReadAll": "Read the full policy"
